{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我看見主站在祭壇旁，祂說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你要擊打柱頂，使殿的根基震動；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要打碎它們，使殿宇坍塌壓死眾人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"僥倖生還的，我要用刀劍殺掉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能逃脫，無人能倖免。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他們挖洞鑽進陰間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要把他們揪出來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他們爬上高天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要把他們拉下來；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他們藏在迦密山的峰頂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要去搜尋，捉住他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他們潛到海底，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要派海蛇去吞咬他們；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使他們被敵人擄去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要命刀劍追殺他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要定睛在他們身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是要賜福而是要降禍。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"主——萬軍之耶和華觸摸大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地就消融，地上的人都要哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地如埃及的尼羅河漲起退落。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那位在天上建造樓閣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大地之上立定穹蒼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召來海水澆在大地上的——","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我眼中，你們不是和古實人一樣嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不是領你們出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領非利士人出迦斐托","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領亞蘭人出吉珥嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華的眼目察看這罪惡的國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要從地上除滅它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不會完全毀滅雅各家。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「因為我要下令在萬國中篩以色列家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像人篩穀物，一粒石子也不會落在地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的子民中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有誇口說『災禍不會追上我們，也不會迎面而來』的罪人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要死在刀下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「到那日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要重建大衛已傾覆的棚子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修補它城牆的缺口。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要從廢墟中重建它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恢復它往日的榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，以色列人必擁有以東所剩的和所有屬於我名下的國家。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是要成就這事的耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「時候將到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五穀還未收完又該耕種了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄還未踩完又該栽種了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甜酒從群山上滴下，在丘嶺間流淌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我被擄的以色列子民返鄉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要重建廢城並住在城中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種葡萄園，喝園中釀出的美酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整理園圃，吃園中出產的佳果。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將以色列人栽種在他們自己的土地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們永不再從我賜給他們的土地上被剷除。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是你們的上帝耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"「迦斐托」即克里特島。","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/OBA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}